  "zh": "# 今日AI安全与产业链动态频发，谷歌Gemini越狱及模型权重泄露引关注。\n## AI 与科技\n- **谷歌 Gemini 越狱**：模型安全防护再现漏洞，提醒企业加强AI防护。\n- **DeepSeek 节假日计费规则**：明确假日费用避免用户争议，体现国内AI服务趋向透明。\n- **AI 重做 黑神话 经典 大战**：AI生成游戏CG引发版权与创意讨论，展示内容生产新范式。\n## 行业动向\n- **央视 起底 速成医师 产业链**：揭露快速培训医生背后的监管空白，关乎公共健康安全。\n- **科学家 人脑细胞植入鼠脑**：跨物种脑细胞移植突破伦理边界，可能改变神经疾病治疗思路。\n- **AI 模型 权重 外泄**：模型参数被盗凸显供应链安全风险，促使行业加密与审计升级。\n## 国际视野\n- **ZK-JPEG 零知识 图像 压缩**：零知识证明应用于图像压缩，兼顾隐私与传输效率前景广阔。\n- **CUA-S1 电脑 使用 模型**：新型交互模型让AI直接操作桌面应用，预示自动化办公新阶段。",
  "en": "# Today's AI news highlights security flaws, industry exposures, and emerging tech like zero‑knowledge image compression.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Google Gemini jailbreak**：Model safety flaws resurface, urging firms to harden AI defenses.\n- **DeepSeek holiday billing rules**：Clear holiday fees prevent user disputes, showing China’s AI services trending toward transparency.\n- **AI Black Myth remake**：AI‑generated game cinematics spark copyright and creativity debates, hinting at a new content‑production paradigm.\n## Industry Trends\n- **CCTV fast‑track physician industry chain**：Exposes regulatory gaps in rapid doctor training, bearing on public health safety.\n- **Scientists human brain cell mouse implant**：Cross‑species brain cell transplantation pushes ethical limits and could reshape neurology therapy.\n- **AI model weights leak**：Stolen model parameters highlight supply‑chain security risks, driving industry toward encryption and audits.\n## Global Outlook\n- **ZK-JPEG zero‑knowledge image compression**：Zero‑knowledge proofs applied to image compression promise privacy‑friendly, efficient data transfer.\n- **CUA-S1 computer use model**：A new interaction model lets AI directly control desktop apps, heralding an era of automated office work."
